{"id":"7f92cb4acad3757e","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-completeness.md","title":"内部强完备性与有限证明证书","display":"thm-completeness — 内部强完备性与有限证明证书","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-completeness","aliases":["29-thm-completeness"],"display":"thm-completeness — 内部强完备性与有限证明证书","depends_on":["[[29-df-logical-consequence]]","[[29-df-godel-numbering]]","[[29-df-computability]]","[[29-df-structure]]"],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-completeness — 内部强完备性与有限证明证书"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"deaf0e86bfe2a066\" href=\"?note=deaf0e86bfe2a066\" title=\"29-df-logical-consequence\">29-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" href=\"?note=a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" title=\"29-df-godel-numbering\">29-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> 为有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(\\tau)\">\\(g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span>；模型为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a> 的任意非空结构，不限于有限结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\varphi\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"deaf0e86bfe2a066\" href=\"?note=deaf0e86bfe2a066\" title=\"29-df-logical-consequence\">29-df-logical-consequence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seqcode}\">\\(\\operatorname{seqcode}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" href=\"?note=a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" title=\"29-df-godel-numbering\">29-df-godel-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^3\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^3\\)</span> 的三个坐标依次为证明证书、有限前提列表代码、结论代码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}_3\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}_3\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a> 的全可计算三元数值函数类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\psi=(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_m)\">\\(\\bar\\psi=(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_m)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_P(p,u,v)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{(p,u,v)\\in P},\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_g(\\bar\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle g(\\psi_1),\\ldots,g(\\psi_m)\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_P(p,u,v)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{(p,u,v)\\in P},\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_g(\\bar\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle g(\\psi_1),\\ldots,g(\\psi_m)\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^3\\;\\left(\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_3\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\left(\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\varphi\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\bar\\psi\\in\\Gamma^m\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p,\\operatorname{code}_g(\\bar\\psi),g(\\varphi))\\in P\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^3\\;\\left(\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_3\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\left(\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\varphi\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\bar\\psi\\in\\Gamma^m\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p,\\operatorname{code}_g(\\bar\\psi),g(\\varphi))\\in P\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原外部完备性链接所需的内部数学内容：任意前提集合的语义后承有有限前提、可判定检查的证明证书。它不是把尚未给定规则的某个 SC 或任意演算假定为完备。取空前提即可得到原 fo-completeness 的递归证明检查存在性；取结论为假式可导出有限前提形式的紧致性。</p>\n<p>此条是依据原完备性条目语境重建的定理陈述，不是缺失第57本书原文的恢复，也未提交该定理的机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"deaf0e86bfe2a066","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt"