"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seqcode}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tot}_3","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\psi=(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_P(p,u,v)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{(p,u,v)\\in P},\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_g(\\bar\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\langle g(\\psi_1),\\ldots,g(\\psi_m)\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^3\\;\\left(\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_3\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\left(\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\varphi\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\bar\\psi\\in\\Gamma^m\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p,\\operatorname{code}_g(\\bar\\psi),g(\\varphi))\\in P\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2447,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-completeness]]、[[29-thm-compactness]]、[[29-thm-trakhtenbrot]] — 仅承接原缺失外部目标所需的定理陈述。"},{"id":"6d4131ca1202619d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c05483682bbb72c7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$，$p,q\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\chi_P$ 为下式的全特征函数。内部定理 [[29-thm-completeness]] 的空前提实例提供该检查关系。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["deaf0e86bfe2a066","a7fafe8aaa1edd6c","a1f1e7424c0c2277","0ac4b9a122d458e2"]}